  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Renforcement de la Coh&#xe9;sion Sociale en Ituri et Nord Kivu II - (Nashiriki Kwa Masikilizano II)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Contract related to: Renforcement de la Coh&#xe9;sion Sociale en Ituri et Nord Kivu II - (Nashiriki Kwa Masikilizano II) - The political, security and humanitarian situation continues to deteriorate in the Democratic Republic of the Congo (DRC) and there is a risk of a spillover of the conflict to the region. Fighting between the Congolese army, in collaboration with local armed groups, and the armed group M23 has intensified further in Eastern DRC, forcing hundreds of thousands of civilians to flee their homes. At the same time, the situation in Mai Ndombe province in the West of the country is suffering from inter-communal conflict, mainly over customary power and land rights. This exceptional assistance measure will provide flexible assistance and support to ongoing peace and stabilisation processes in DRC through social cohesion, dialogue and mediation initiatives.</narrative>
  </description>
